<p>After ~10 years of working, studying, and often doing both at the same time, B felt it was time to take a proper break.</p>
<p>She moved to Bangkok, Thailand, where the lower cost of living gave her the time and freedom to explore new things, learn, travel and figure out what she wanted to do next.</p>
